      "body": "<div class=\"white\" id=\"audience\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-8 col-lg-push-2\">\n<p class=\"audience-intro\">\n<p>The Summit has experienced tremendous growth since its inception, and we're proud of the diverse audience reached at each one. Here's a quick look at the audience who attended the Barcelona Summit in October 2016.</p>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-12\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title\"></h5>\nOctober 2016 Barcelona OpenStack Summit Metrics:\n<div class=\"row\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-5 col-lg-push-1 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-5 col-lg-push-1 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
